<script setup lang="ts">import {ref,computed,onMounted} from 'vue';import {models} from '../stores/models';import {canWrite} from '../stores/auth';import {useTask} from '../hooks/useTask';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import Notice from '../components/common/Notice.vue';import CoefficientTable from '../components/CoefficientTable.vue';const name=ref(''),description=ref(''),intercept=ref(240),selected=ref('demo-model'),factors=ref("factor_id,name,unit,linear,quadratic\nflow,冷却水流量,m³/h,3.5,0.08\ninlet,入口水温,°C,14,0.12\nload,热负荷比,1,650,85\nfan,风机频率,Hz,2.2,0.025\napproach,逼近温差,°C,22,0.7\neff,泵效率,%, -4,0.012"),interactions=ref("left,right,coefficient\nload,fan,3.2\ninlet,approach,0.75\nflow,load,1.8");const {error,busy,act}=useTask();onMounted(models.load);const model=computed(()=>models.items.value.find(r=>r.id===selected.value));function submit(){act(async()=>{const r=await models.create({name:name.value,description:description.value,intercept:intercept.value,response_unit:'kWh',factors_csv:factors.value,interactions_csv:interactions.value});selected.value=r.id;name.value=''})}</script><template><PageHeading index="01 / 响应模型" title="系数是数据，模型有明确的边界。" note="只接受2–6因子的线性、二次与两两交互项，不执行eval。各系数使用声明物理单位，输出固定为模拟kWh。"/><div class="two-col"><section><label>代理模型<select v-model="selected"><option v-for="r in models.items.value" :key="r.id" :value="r.id">{{r.name}}</option></select></label><template v-if="model"><h2>{{model.name}}</h2><CoefficientTable :model="model"/><p class="method-note">{{model.description}}</p></template></section><form v-if="canWrite()" class="editor-panel" @submit.prevent="submit"><h2>记录代理模型</h2><label>模型名称<input v-model="name" required minlength="2"></label><label>截距 / kWh<input type="number" v-model.number="intercept" step="any" required></label><label>因子系数CSV<textarea v-model="factors" rows="8" required></textarea></label><label>交互项CSV<textarea v-model="interactions" rows="5"></textarea></label><label>模型来源说明<input v-model="description"></label><Notice :message="error"/><button :disabled="busy">校验并保存模型</button></form></div></template>
